1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,540
This is it.

2
00:00:01,090 --> 00:00:02,630
This is the perfect French fry.

3
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,570
The secret to super crispy fries.

4
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:05,810
Start with agria potatoes.

5
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,530
This particular potato variety.

6
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,490
Is a very high starch content.

7
00:00:09,710 --> 00:00:10,870
And a very low water content.

8
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,350
Perfect for crispiness.

9
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:12,850
Peel.

10
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:13,910
Trim the ends and sides.

11
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:15,170
And cut them off lengthways.

12
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:16,190
Into uniform fries.

13
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:17,790
Roughly one centimetre square.

14
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,110
Soak them in cold water.

15
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,490
To remove any excess starch.

16
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:21,890
And wash them a few times.

17
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:23,630
Until the water runs perfectly clear.

18
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:24,930
Bring a pot of water to the boil.

19
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:25,850
Add baking soda.

20
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,790
Which is going to help them to fluff and break down.

21
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:28,310
And salt.

22
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:29,190
Which is going to season them.

23
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,550
Then boil the fries until just.

24
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:30,890
Tender.

25
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:32,010
They should break without snapping.

26
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,930
Drain just lightly with potato starch.

27
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,730
This is going to add a beautiful crispy layer.

28
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:37,690
And then place them into the fridge or freezer.

29
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:38,710
To completely cool.

30
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:39,670
Heat oil in a pot.

31
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,210
We've got some duck fat too for flavour.

32
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:43,670
And once it reaches around about 140 degrees.

33
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,030
We're going to drop in our fries.

34
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,010
And par-fry them.

35
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:46,690
Or blanch them.

36
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:48,330
Stirring constantly for ruffled edges.

37
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:49,030
Remove them.

38
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:49,810
Lay them in a tray.

39
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:51,070
And freeze or chill again.

40
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:52,030
For the final fry.

41
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,010
Heat the oil up to 190.

42
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:54,630
Fry until golden and crispy.

43
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:56,190
Finish with a sprinkle of maldon salt.

44
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:57,030
Extra crunch.
